{"overview":"میخائیل سرهنگی است که مسئول BOPE است و همواره در مأموریت‌های خطرناک در ریودوژانیرو شرکت می‌کند. اما پس از درگیر شدن در عملیاتی جنجالی که به کشتار منجر شد، به یک واحد پلیس در مناطق روستایی ایالت منتقل می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Mikhael is a sergeant in charge of BOPE, always on dangerous missions in Rio de Janeiro. But after getting involved in a controversial operation that culminated to a slaughter, he is transferred to a police unit at the state countryside.","tagline_en":"","runtime":45,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2020,"poster":"/gnGD338eehThLKH76oWHjDjW8tz.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2022,"poster":"/rYz3o3C9zfX078LVLVrOfiOHSHG.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2024,"poster":"/htQ7JUhr477DjWapcDVQc9gRUQ.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/p7gsnKeSQsyNYO7QrW5xedd3QTe.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/5nOTUbAcFahd2I32V8nVyjMrPdJ.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":""}],"episodes":50,"crew":["José Júnior"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["BR"],"cast":[{"name":"Marcelo Mello Jr.","role":"Mikhael","photo":"/11mEetai4q9W0tj52K2GLjBUDHT.jpg"},{"name":"Erika Januza","role":"Sarah","photo":"/dP64ZXsArRLDCm0fuJpFlP1WmD.jpg"},{"name":"Álamo Facó","role":"Ronaldo Leitão","photo":"/cwscLmJqEWzIR4C0moB7aEFSVsi.jpg"},{"name":"Flávio Bauraqui","role":"Barata","photo":"/kqTAOpegEqpssNhrlSYgrFJGX5Y.jpg"},{"name":"Leonardo Brício","role":"Coronel Gabriel","photo":"/rWoNLaIaGchwRCo7bLrJRiIlUvO.jpg"},{"name":"Rita Guedes","role":"Manuela Berengher","photo":"/sWnUBwepChKR8Qi6F7LHcbKLTJg.jpg"},{"name":"Léa Garcia","role":"Dona Laura","photo":"/zNVk9FWikhnGiKZnsmyk2k2oThX.jpg"},{"name":"Tatsu Carvalho","role":"Antônio Faustini","photo":"/bBdgSGm2av9W6AzTsgPVWD1CbdJ.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":["s292742"],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/99125"}